 - `npm run dev` starts Vite at `http://127.0.0.1:5173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
 - `npm run preview` serves the production build at `http://127.0.0.1:4173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
-- `npm run check` runs ESLint, Prettier check, TypeScript, and production build.
+- `npm test` runs the Node built-in visual preference regressions.
+- `npm run check` runs ESLint, Prettier check, the tests, TypeScript, and production build.
+
+## Visual Preferences
+
+The backdrop variant and color theme are stored together in localStorage under
+`tahion.visual.preferences` as `{ "version": 1, "variant": "signal", "theme": "acid" }`.
+On first load, if that record is absent, valid values from the legacy raw-string keys
+`tahion.backdrop.variant` and `tahion.backdrop.theme` are combined independently, with
+`signal` and `acid` as field defaults, and migrated to the new key. Legacy keys are
+never changed. A malformed, unsupported, or unknown-version current record is ignored
+and not overwritten. Other tabs synchronize valid current records and key removal;
+invalid or unrelated storage events are ignored.
 
